WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,540
Sandwiches cost five bucks each

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,940
A bottle of milk costs seven yuan

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,270
It sounds normal

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:12,190
Not as delicious as Lao Wang's steamed buns

5
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:15,700
Ordinary boxed milk replaced with a bottle

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,180
Price doubled or tripled

7
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:23,900
They sell more than just breakfast

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,460
What sells is a sense of sophistication

9
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,700
What else can we do?

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,940
Moving a store is so troublesome

11
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:38,870
Why not make the buns more delicious first?

12
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,390
Eating meat is too ordinary
